Oh, 100%.

1490
01:16:57.380 --> 01:16:59.060
Only sometimes, they said.

1491
01:16:59.180 --> 01:17:00.820
Only sometimes her voice is shrill.

1492
01:17:00.820 --> 01:17:03.220
I guarantee you someone was like, well, what can we say?

1493
01:17:03.220 --> 01:17:05.100
I don't know, maybe her voice gets grating.

1494
01:17:05.280 --> 01:17:06.980
Yeah, for sure.

1495
01:17:07.000 --> 01:17:08.580
Sorry, all you podcast listeners.

1496
01:17:08.980 --> 01:17:13.760
I had an audition one time for a national campaign for bananas.

1497
01:17:14.240 --> 01:17:15.000
Go on.

1498
01:17:15.140 --> 01:17:15.400
Yeah.

1499
01:17:15.780 --> 01:17:20.240
You had to eat a banana in the audition, and I didn't get the part.

1500
01:17:20.720 --> 01:17:27.040
The casting director, as I was delivering my lines, she said, I'm sorry, I'm going to

1501
01:17:27.040 --> 01:17:27.460
stop you.

1502
01:17:29.040 --> 01:17:30.920
Can you lower your register?

1503
01:17:32.620 --> 01:17:35.980
And I said, oh, okay.

1504
01:17:36.620 --> 01:17:43.000
So I have to take a bite of the banana, and then say the line, whatever the line is, these

1505
01:17:43.000 --> 01:17:45.120
bananas are great, whatever it was.

1506
01:17:45.120 --> 01:17:45.840
I can't remember.

1507
01:17:46.100 --> 01:17:50.340
But so I went, I guess I was going like, these bananas are great, or something.

1508
01:17:50.620 --> 01:17:54.880
And so then I took a bite of the banana, and you guys take a bite of banana, and then

1509
01:17:54.880 --> 01:17:55.800
try to say a line.

1510
01:17:56.460 --> 01:17:59.500
Then I'm like, these bananas are great.

1511
01:17:59.840 --> 01:18:01.280
I didn't get it.

1512
01:18:01.460 --> 01:18:08.500
But for the rest of my career, I thought, oh my gosh, is my voice shrill and grating?

1513
01:18:08.740 --> 01:18:14.120
And I asked my agent when I didn't get it, I was like, was it because she wanted me to

1514
01:18:14.120 --> 01:18:15.060
lower my register?

1515
01:18:15.220 --> 01:18:17.120
Did she say something about my register?

1516
01:18:17.660 --> 01:18:23.380
And my agent said, no, she actually said, they thought the way you ate the banana was

1517
01:18:23.380 --> 01:18:23.840
awkward.

1518
01:18:29.980 --> 01:18:31.240
Actors make it.

1519
01:18:31.420 --> 01:18:32.740
How do you come back from that?

1520
01:18:32.740 --> 01:18:33.580
I don't know.

1521
01:18:33.760 --> 01:18:35.440
How does that not give you a complex?

1522
01:18:35.860 --> 01:18:36.520
I don't know.

1523
01:18:36.560 --> 01:18:40.020
In two areas, your voice and your banana eating.

1524
01:18:40.480 --> 01:18:40.900
I know.

1525
01:18:41.140 --> 01:18:43.400
That was always such a tricky thing.

1526
01:18:43.400 --> 01:18:49.000
You'd go to an audition, and then you wouldn't get it, and you would just want to know anything.

1527
01:18:49.000 --> 01:18:51.240
You would say, was there any feedback?

1528
01:18:51.460 --> 01:18:52.040
Any feedback.

1529
01:18:52.200 --> 01:18:53.320
Desperate for feedback.

1530
01:18:53.560 --> 01:18:54.460
Oh my gosh.

1531
01:18:54.460 --> 01:18:55.980
So you could do it better next time.

1532
01:18:55.980 --> 01:18:56.920
So you could learn.

1533
01:18:57.120 --> 01:19:03.040
